["<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">墜落</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ついらく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">坠落；（飞机等）失事</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"125707\"><ruby>墜落<rp>(</rp><rt>ついらく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>向<rp>(</rp><rt>む</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>けて<ruby>用意<rp>(</rp><rt>ようい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>整<rp>(</rp><rt>ととの</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>えられた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他们已经准备好到坠落。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">通</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">つう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"v-m\">权威；专家；行家；见多识广的人；（用于消息、信件、便条、文件等的数量词）；（尤指男女关系方面的）理解力；处世的分寸；洞察力；超自然力；魔力</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">痛感</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">つうかん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">深切感受；充分认识</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"230943\">あの<ruby>事故<rp>(</rp><rt>じこ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>見<rp>(</rp><rt>み</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>て<ruby>自然<rp>(</rp><rt>しぜん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>力<rp>(</rp><rt>ちから</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>痛感<rp>(</rp><rt>つうかん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>した。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">看到事故,我感觉到自然的力量。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">通常</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">つうじょう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">通常；寻常；普通；正常；一般；普遍</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"147241\"><ruby>女性<rp>(</rp><rt>じょせい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>通常<rp>(</rp><rt>つうじょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>男性<rp>(</rp><rt>だんせい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>よりも<ruby>長生<rp>(</rp><rt>ながい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>きする。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">女人通常比男人寿命长。 <a class=\"ex-attribution\" href=\"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/9701594\" title=\"Tatoeba · KuroiKarasu\" aria-label=\"Tatoeba · KuroiKarasu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">↗</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">痛切</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">つうせつ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">深切的；强烈的；衷心的</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">杖</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">つえ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">拐杖；手杖；杖；魔杖</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"146033\"><ruby>杖<rp>(</rp><rt>つえ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>何<rp>(</rp><rt>なん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>役<rp>(</rp><rt>やく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にも<ruby>立<rp>(</rp><rt>た</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>たなかった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他的杖对他毫无用处。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">遣い</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">つかい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" da