an class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">主持；管理；掌管；执掌；主办；统治；统御；支配；控制</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"168334\"><ruby>市長<rp>(</rp><rt>しちょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>市政<rp>(</rp><rt>しせい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>司<rp>(</rp><rt>つかさど</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>る。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">市长负责市政。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">束の間</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">つかのま</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">片刻；瞬间；短暂的时间</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">付き</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">つき</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">配备；附带；附着；贴附；印象；外观；神态；运气；幸运；社交能力；交际性；助手；副手；……长的助理；汤底；高汤</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">月並み</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">つきなみ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">每月；月月；陈腐；平凡；老套；平庸</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"175612\"><ruby>月並<rp>(</rp><rt>つきな</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>みのパーティーだったよ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这是一个月亮的派对。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">尽きる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">つきる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">用尽；耗尽；消耗完；告终</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"127379\"><ruby>探検隊<rp>(</rp><rt>たんけんたい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>糧食<rp>(</rp><rt>りょうしょく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はすぐ<ruby>尽<rp>(</rp><rt>つ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>きてしまった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">探险队的粮食很快就耗尽了。 <a class=\"ex-attribution\" href=\"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/340125\" title=\"Tatoeba · nickyeow\" aria-label=\"Tatoeba · nickyeow\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">↗</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">継ぎ目</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">つぎめ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">接缝；接头；接合处</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"229126\">いすの<ruby>継<rp>(</rp><rt>つ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ぎ<ruby>目<rp>(</rp><rt>め</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はぐらぐらしていた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">那时的继承人,就被打破了。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">吐く</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">つく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">呼气；呼吸；说谎；说脏话；出口成脏；呕吐；吐出；吐</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"140208\"><ruby>息<rp>(</rp><rt>いき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>深<rp>(</rp><rt>ふか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>く<ruby>吸<rp>(</rp><rt>す</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ったり<ruby>吐<rp>(</rp><rt>つ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いたりしてください。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">请深呼吸或吐气。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span